Lemma art_shadow_allowed_sub : forall A a n a' n', shadow_allowed A a n -> a <= a' -> a' + n' <= a + n -> 0 < n' -> shadow_allowed A a' n'.
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S00$A;R!1+0!2+1+2+2$a;R+2$n;R+2$a';R+2$n';R+2$SA;R!3'3#5#4#3$H1;R!2'4#5#3$H2;R!2'4!2'5#4#3!2'5#6#5$H3;R!2'6,7#4vd$x;R+2$Hx;R!3'8#7#6#1!2#6#2!9'9#:#9#8#7#2#5#4#3#1!3'3#9#6#5").
Qed.

